Z||000005||California Kid||11-29-2001||11:12 PM||||Yes '98 Viper yellow is different the any year used after it.<P>If you want to go crazy the 2000 Diablo used a Metallic Yellow that is awesome. Only problem is that your Fiero will have to be take apart, panels paint white, re-assembled, and the car shot yellow as a whole. Any touch ups or repair become risky, that's why I didn't go with it.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Diablo.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Diablo_2.jpg"> <p>[This message has been edited by California Kid (edited 11-29-2001).]||||reg||1
