Z||000012||mrtgman||11-30-2001||01:24 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Alex4mula:<BR><B>Yellow craze! Cool   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> A pearl mix would be nice. But then you may have the same problems as the Diablo yellow. I picked Lexus Solar yellow as my final option. I guess is the same as 2001 MR2.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hey Alex,<P>I just got back from the corvette dealer. I am thinking the corvette yellow with pearl for now.It really looks sharp on the vette and I think adding pearl would give it a unique look.Tommarow I am going to try to find a yellow viper to look at.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierofront1_1.jpg">   86 gt owned since new!<A HREF="http://www.palmbeachloan.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.palmbeachloan.com</A>||||reg||1
