Z||000014||JD86GT350||11-30-2001||07:07 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/84fieroside.jpg"> <P>that's Viper Yellow (dunno year)<BR>Chrysler Code JE<BR>PPG # 83431<BR>with some sunset red pearl (PRL 96) shot in a mid-coat.  You won't see the pearl at all in the pic, in fact you have to look to see it on the car, but once you notice it, you really appreciate it.  <B>But</B> if its ever wrecked, its going to need a complete again, because there's no way to get a perfect match.  Unless you get lucky on a blend.||||reg||1
